# GitHub linguist configuration — keep language statistics reflecting
# actual project source (Rust + tooling), not test fixtures or data.

# Binary class-file fixtures for the parser test suite (~20.7k files):
# test data, also collapsed in diffs/PRs.
crates/classfile/testcases/** linguist-vendored

# Verification corpus: the Java feature-suite sources are TEST FIXTURES
# (compiled, decompiled, and behavior-compared by scripts/verify.py).
# Without this they make the repo look part-Java. The JDK download
# manifest data lives here too.
corpus/** linguist-vendored

# Prose documentation (Markdown is excluded from stats by default;
# explicit so future non-Markdown docs stay out too).
docs/** linguist-documentation
